{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20039","headline":"赠万年陆郎中 · 孟郊","name":"赠万年陆郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天子忧剧县，寄深华省郎。\n纷纷风响佩，蛰蛰劒开霜。\n旧事笑堆案，新声唯雅章。\n谁言百里才，终作横天梁。\n江鸿耻承眷，云津未能翔。\n徘徊尘俗中，短毳无辉光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20039.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20039","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}